## Do Not Let Hot Viewers Drop Off at the Finish Line

You hooked the audience, demonstrated the product flawlessly, and kept them engaged for 12 seconds. If your outro fades away weakly with a quiet logo screen, **you will lose up to 50% of potential buyers**.

### Best Practices for Outros:
- Pair an upbeat auditory "whoosh" or "ding" with the appearance of your discount offer.
- Specify the exact action: "Tap the shop button below to grab your 50% off bundle."
- Flash trust badges: "30-Day Money-Back Guarantee" and "Free Express Shipping".
